type = "Tag_Monitor_Plugin"
description = "Provides a mechanism to remotely monitor tags from the system.  All tags are returned as double data type.  Double, I64, U64 tag types can be monitored.  I64 and U64 will be coerced to floating point, this can cause errors for large values.  "
